## Prompt Conventions

- Prompts use structured output with XML tags (`<report>`, `<post>`, `<thinking>`)
- Business context focuses on AI applications, agents, RAG, multi-modal AI
- Post structure: 5-word hook + 3-sentence body + 3-6 word call-to-action
- Style: casual, present tense, minimal emojis, developer-focused
- Thread format: 3-10 posts targeting AI enthusiasts and developers
